[1.259293, "o", "{\r\r\n  \"status\": \"GROUNDED\",\r\r\n  \"answer\": \"Evidence: `prash/server.py:L2641-L2700`. - [implemented] For the duration of that call the handler swaps `cli.CliAsk` for an ask object that always answers yes, so prompts raised by the permission engine are approved automatically. [1] Evidence: `prash/cli.py:L1254`, `prash/cli.py:L277`. - [implemented] A dry run consults the permission engine but never calls `execute`; a refusal is reported as refused instead of showing a plan. [3]\",\r\r\n  \"citations\": [\r\r\n    {\r\r\n      \"id\": 1,\r\r\n      \"chunkId\": \"src-0aa7224dfb#c008-2447b1e4\",\r\r\n      \"document\": \"docs/lear_backend/api_reference.md\",\r\r\n      \"heading\": \"API reference > The desktop HTTP/WebSocket API > Selected endpoints\",\r\r\n      \"lines\": \"56-60\",\r\r\n      \"linePrecision\": \"lines\",\r\r\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\r\r\n        \"prash/server.py:L704-L722\",\r\r\n        \"prash/server.py:L2641-L2700\",\r\r\n        \"prash/server.py:L2705-L2726\"\r\r\n      ],\r\r\n      \"commit\": \"60cf9abf8408\",\r\r\n      \"support\": 0.3764,\r\r\n      \"excerpt\": \"Evidence: `prash/server.py:L2641-L2700`.\\n\\n- [implemented] For the duration of that call the handler swaps `cli.CliAsk` for an ask object that always answers yes, so prompts raised by the permission engine are approved automatically.\"\r\r\n    },\r\r\n    {\r\r\n      \"id\": 3,\r\r\n      \"chunkId\": \"src-51cdac4a6f#c008-f9566633\",\r\r\n      \"document\": \"docs/lear_backend/authentication_authorization.md\",\r\r\n      \"heading\": \"Authentication and authorization > Dry runs\",\r\r\n      \"lines\": \"43-46\",\r\r\n      \"linePrecision\": \"lines\",\r\r\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\r\r\n        \"prash/cli.py:L1254\",\r\r\n        \"prash/cli.py:L277\",\r\r\n        \"prash/dispatch.py:L177-L209\",\r\r\n        \"tests/test_actions.py:L187-L217\",\r\r\n        \"tests/test_actions.py:L854-L861\"\r\r\n      ],\r\r\n      \"commit\": \"60cf